      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Fly-half crisis",
          "heading": "Galthié adds Desperes and Le Brun as Jalibert, Ntamack miss Springboks test",
          "body": "Fabien Galthié, France head coach, has brought Axel Desperes and Louis Le Brun into preparations for Friday's Springboks test in Paris, widening a fly-half pool stripped by injury. Matthieu Jalibert, Romain Ntamack and Antoine Hastoy are all ruled out, and Thomas Ramos, who has covered No. 10 before, is sidelined too. Reports in France tip Maxime Lucu to start there, but Springboks head coach Rassie Erasmus expects a different route: \"It will be Lucu or the 13,\" he said after naming his team."
