          "heading": "Ireland v Fiji and Republic of Ireland's Austria game clash on Saturday",
          "body": "Fans have only just clocked the collision: Ireland head coach Andy Farrell's side host Fiji at the Aviva Stadium on Saturday, the same evening the Republic of Ireland football side play Austria in Linz in the Nations League. Caolan's post on X, \"That's a pain.\", has drawn more than 330 likes, with some fans arguing the schedule should have been different. Ireland beat Argentina 42-12 last Friday, and Fiji are next at the Aviva."
