          "heading": "Tommaso Di Bartolomeo says Italy will target Argentina's scrum and lineout",
          "body": "Zebre hooker Tommaso Di Bartolomeo says Italy want to press Argentina on efficiency, ball-winning phases and the scrum and lineout. Speaking after the squad's first day on the grass in Turin, he said the Pumas, beaten 42-12 by Ireland in Dublin, will arrive keen to play their best game. He expects an even contest in which the side bringing more intensity and precision wins, and admitted much could have been done better against South Africa."
