          "heading": "WRU cuts student tickets for Wales v All Blacks to £20",
          "body": "A flash sale that went live on Tuesday, four days before Saturday's Wales v New Zealand match at the Principality Stadium, cuts student tickets to £20. Upper-tier student seats, priced at £62.50, have been cut by more than 63%, and Category B seats near the halfway line, £98 for adults, are part of the £20 offer. The WRU is trying to boost the crowd: last weekend's Japan match drew 52,425, against 61,324 a year earlier, after the union recently posted annual losses of £18m."
