          "body": "Three players who missed the England defeat are in contention for the Scotland test. Tom Hooper's shoulder problem was re-aggravated with Exeter last month. Flyhalf Carter Gordon is still returning from the broken leg he suffered against Argentina in September, while hooker Brandon Paenga-Amosa has had knee bruising from the Sydney training camp. Scrum coach John Ulugia said: \"Everyone's on deck.\" The side is due to be named on Friday."
